Chapter: UnknownPatternCtor

  cites Foreword chapter Maybe

 Maybe's constructors are Just and None. The Some arm below names a
 constructor that does not exist; before CDX2072 it compiled into an
 arm that could never match, and the when fell through to empty
 output at runtime. This is how channel-test shipped broken.

Section: Definitions

  describe : Maybe Integer -> Text
  describe (m) = when m
    is Some (v) -> "value"
    is None -> "empty"

  opening : Text = describe (Just 42)

